sequenceDiagram
    actor S as 学生
    participant A as 应用
    participant H as 慧图平台
    participant C as 杭电 SSO

    S->>A: 输入学号/密码
    A->>H: GET /User/Index/hduCASLogin
    H-->>C: 302 跳转 SSO
    C-->>A: 登录表单 + croypto + execution
    A->>A: AES-128/ECB/Pkcs7 加密密码
    A->>C: POST 登录表单
    C-->>A: 302 返回 ticket
    A->>H: 携带 ticket 落地会话
    H-->>A: auth / uid Cookie
    A->>H: GET /User/Center/baseInfo
    H-->>A: DATA.is_login + DATA.uid
    A->>A: 保存 session.cache 与 credentials.yaml
    A-->>S: 认证成功
